<view class="page login-page">
  <text class="page-title">登录 SoleMuse</text>
  <text class="page-subtitle">登录后可以发布、点赞、收藏、评论并管理个人内容。</text>
  <view class="panel login-note">
    <text class="panel-title">骨架开发模式</text>
    <text class="muted">后端认证方案尚未确定，当前按钮仅创建本地演示会话，不代表正式微信授权流程。</text>
  </view>
  <button
    class="primary-button"
    loading="{{submitting}}"
    disabled="{{submitting}}"
    bindtap="handleLogin"
  >进入本地演示</button>
</view>
